//scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uKpjQCM-9PcQ7kNvwFgv5Io&_nc_oc=AdqI_Ggcfxwm5kuLRoW8v0TshO-I5iDWK17vRSNeCFmYJaC4x9pe5AwS2b0VSIh_58E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRV5WXJpFdX1RMoMvjUOh4ixkbgl2TTof1bzhnZNCttXw&oe=6B0B0F60"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UOSQIeLr7HEQ7kNvwFUGtkT&_nc_oc=Adpfj8pboIMjNbDUd-HAU63QuL0Ga_nZBvmw-C6NjdMMZXaS3uv_5JTAy6b7ugTE4PE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT9AM72XzYof5EDDc4E4jw9qEd3LlF41x5ZiuuOJYdqBg&oe=6B0B18E2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQ81s8SRqLQQ7kNvwGBQI7-&_nc_oc=AdqZVjflZoSGbNAOU0Eakd1t7WU6OqeqZcUO4vlAbfGRfqXuqKPb5tTS8hj0cxvHpiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTeoqmVIXNzPY0yu6SNfL5mHCTv8KOoMMt0mrU643m7kw&oe=6B0B3FC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkQW40mX6eAQ7kNvwHgr1Pr&_nc_oc=AdohZ09osJmANAV2-0uh9HAhM4XbUBYTohYwgHbIhSObvIvB23UllHov7IR_HW4L1MI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS13CwjNey4dLJJHXZ3Wv98tGvH9K4P9hW3sAk5c3HohQ&oe=6B0B2DD2"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/", "category": null, "c